# Little Multiball for iomoon, isolated.
#
# The Monolith chases rather than resting, so no scripted key can be timed to
# LPA3 -- a lock lands on it about one time in ten.  This script therefore does
# NOT press J at all: the run is driven with SLEIC_LM_AUTO, a closed loop that
# waits for the ORBITS count to reach its cap and then takes the lock on the
# frame LPA3 is actually lit, holding the C46 contact afterwards so the ball
# stays locked.  See dmd/little-multiball/README.md.
#
# What the script does: spell ORBITS, then plunge the replacement ball and work
# scoop 1 repeatedly across a wide window, because the lock lands whenever LPA3
# next comes round and the collect has to follow it.  Little Multiball pays at
# scoop 1: one ball locked with LPA3 lit lights LTB12 there, a ball is served,
# and putting that ball into scoop 1 releases the Jupiter ball (rules 3.2.6).
#
# Needs a seeded NVRAM with credits -- see dmd/multiball/README.md.
500 mark boot
560 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
620 mark start
900 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
960 mark plunge
1200 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1255 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1263 mark orbits-1
1330 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1385 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1393 mark orbits-2
1460 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1515 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1523 mark orbits-3
1590 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1645 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1653 mark orbits-4
1720 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1775 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1783 mark orbits-5
1850 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1905 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1913 mark orbits-6
1980 mark orbits-complete
2100 mark lock-window-opens
3500 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
3508 mark replacement-ball
3740 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
3748 mark scoop1-collect-1
4040 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
4048 mark scoop1-collect-2
4340 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
4348 mark scoop1-collect-3
4640 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
4648 mark scoop1-collect-4
4940 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
4948 mark scoop1-collect-5
5240 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
5248 mark scoop1-collect-6
5540 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
5548 mark scoop1-collect-7
5840 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
5848 mark scoop1-collect-8
6140 mark little-multiball-done
6540 mark end
6690 quit
